    "playerData::NextHero": "Compare current hero before the indexed hero ID. Complete body and references are exact.",
    "townManager::DoTavern": "Remove unusedValue and its zero initialization: neither the store nor its local slot exists in retail. Keep window, dialog and music operations intact. Complete body and references are exact.",
