    "textWidget constructor": "Store color before alignment and widget kind. All initialization values remain unchanged; complete body and references are exact.",
    "executive::RemoveManager": "Compare manager-list head before tail. Complete body and references are exact.",
    "army::GetMoveMask": "Restore the separate west/east wide-direction bit expressions instead of a combined constant. Complete instructions and ordered references correspond; local placement remains non-exact.",
